{"unit_id":"Semidia__dsh-session-manager#card-zh","repo":"Semidia/dsh-session-manager","commit":"d4f6f857e79b042b33ee6b2882e368b996fa14a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Manager 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的会话管理插件，在侧边栏会话行提供右键菜单，并在侧边栏底部加入当前会话管理入口。它使用公开的会话、工作区和插槽服务，支持置顶、未读标记、重命名、归档、创建分支、导出 ZIP、复制会话信息，以及打开工作区目录。适合需要集中整理和操作多个 DSH 会话的用户。使用前需安装插件，并为会话行应用 data-session-id 补丁；置顶和未读标记保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:273","lib/client.js:465","lib/client.js:673"]}
{"unit_id":"Semidia__dsh-session-manager#card-en","repo":"Semidia/dsh-session-manager","commit":"d4f6f857e79b042b33ee6b2882e368b996fa14a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Manager adds a right-click menu to DSH Web sessions and a footer manager for the current session. It supports pinning, unread markers, rename, archive, fork, ZIP export, copying details, and opening workspace folders. Apply the data-session-id patch; state stays in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:273","lib/client.js:465","lib/client.js:673"]}
